Introducing MultiCraft ― world of unlimited opportunities! Get ready for real Adventures!

Build and destroy Blocks, gather Resources, and create a variety of Tools, Items, and Weapons to Survive and create unique Buildings. Show off your skills in Building and Survival in this thrilling world where every step presents an opportunity for new discoveries and adventures. Join us and dive into the world of MultiCraft today!

In this world, the choice is yours — become a Builder in Creative mode or a Ruthless Hunter fighting for survival in Survival mode!

► Be careful, in this world not only peaceful Animals, but an awful Monsters too! Win a battle with them and you will get priceless resources!
► Swim across the seas for new lands and resources ― lands are unlimited. Exploration them!
► If you decided to Survive ― keep eye on hunger and fill out it in time! Search for food, grow plants and kill mobs for meat!
► Built your shelter from the monsters and you will survive this night! They are coming for you… Zombies, Skeletons, Huge Spiders and other hostile mobs.
► At any time you can fly to the skies with the «Fly» mode or become fast as flash with the «Fast» mode.
► Set your Home Point, create Waypoints, and adjust the Time of Day. Play by your own rules, because it's your own world!

Your actions are limited only by your imagination in this game! No specific skills required — you'll understand the basics within the first few minutes. With MultiCraft, you can have fun anywhere, anytime! And it’s totally FREE!

Do you want to play with your friends? Join one of the many custom servers («Multiplayer» tab) or create your own («Host Server» tab) for free. The game has a constantly updated list of various servers. You're sure to find one you like!

In our game, you can expect:
► Peaceful mobs like Cows, Pigs, and Sheep;
► Wolves and Dogs;
► Huge and Small Spiders;
► Insidious Skeletons with Bows;
► Powerful Zombies and other hostile mobs;
► Red and Blue ore, mechanisms and hoppers;
► A realistic gaming experience;
► Pandas, Penguins and Seals;
► Egg-carrying Chickens;
► Stable FPS and drawing world without lag;
► High game optimization and world generation for all modern devices;
► Various biomes and a unique world terrain;
► A wide variety of food and plant items;
► Crafting Guide with a list of all items and recipes;
► Reworked touch controls for easy gameplay;
► Singleplayer with Survival and Creative modes;
► Easy game mode switching in the Main Menu;
► Accelerated flight and walking;
► Multiplayer mode on numerous free servers;
► Free creation of your own server to play with your friends directly in the game menu.

IQ Boost is a game with tricky puzzles, tasks and logic tests. 
All the tasks are original and funny! We said ‘NO’ to boring brain training.
Free IQ Boost game features only the best tasks, brainteasers and exercises to train your memory, attention, logic and mindset. 

Only 10% of all the people have an IQ higher than 120. Are you among them? Play IQ Boost - challenge your brain.

Try yourself in solving nontrivial tasks. You will train logical and abstract thinking by solving puzzles and logic tasks. Сoncentration and memory will be better too. 
Have a good time while training your brain. 

Find out your IQ level. Lower than you thought? Play IQ Boost and you’ll see your IQ is growing. 

Game features:
• Easy to play;
• Nonstandard colourful gameplay;
• Funny answers and solutions;
• Nontrivial challenges for any age;
• Lots of levels;
• Intellectual brain-teaser game.

Remember: obvious solutions might not be not always right...think out of the box and train your brain! Play and prove you are the cleverest!

Ragnarok Origin: ROO — a sequel to the beloved, classic RO. Officially developed and operated by Gravity.
Participate in the new server launch events to win luxurious rewards and embark on a new adventure!

Immerse yourself in a vast fantasy world full of mysterious monsters and extraordinary characters. Explore massive landscapes, legendary kingdoms, and dreadful dungeons with your pets and pals!

===Highlighted Features===
Explore a Vast Fantasy World — An Adventure Awaits
Change Classes at Your Will — Endless Fun
Full Character Customization — Deep RPG Experience
Thrilling PvP and GvG Battles — Glorious and Furious
Immersive Social Features — Meet New Friends
High-Quality 3D Graphics — A Visual Feast

===Unlimited Character Customization===
-Upgrade and enchant your weapons, armor, cards, and many more to refine your build;
-Customize the skills on your skill bar to get prepared for different encounters;
-Switch among different Jobs at your will;

===Epic Fantasy Journey===
-Discover mysterious locations and secrets hidden in a detailed world;
-Choose your path and embark on unique missions, events, and daily quests;
-Collect, train, and evolve pets to fight by your side;
-Meet friends and defeat powerful foes together;

===Fast-paced Action Combats===
-Hundreds of items and skills with amazing animations and visual effects;
-Optimized controls allow swift response to changing battlefield conditions;
-Fight for glory in arenas and battlegrounds;
-Plan battle strategies, learn new techniques, and prepare potions for battles;

===Immersive Social Features===
-Adventure with your friends in real life or strangers you just met! Enjoy unique dungeons, challenges, and stories together!
-Everyone plays an important role in the group. Tank, DPS, or Support? Which role will you take to make your team unstoppable?
-Enjoy guild feasts, guild matches, and guild vs. guild tournaments with your guild mates!

===Make Yourself Shine===
-Show off your style with hundreds of outfits, hats, and accessories to choose from;
-Use the Wardrobe system to get dressed anytime, anywhere;

===A Beautiful World===
-Feast your eyes on the open world with vibrant, high-definition graphics;
-Enchanting BGM in each area to set the mood;
-Every detail, from lighting to sound effects, from the environment to climate, is brought to life;

===Cross-platform Play===
-Link your Mobile and PC accounts!
-Enjoy anytime, anywhere, on any device

Kind Reminder
Ragnarok Origin is free to download, with some of its contents and features requiring in-app payment;
Please keep your gaming time in check, and maintain proper rest.

